  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5102.65 Lake Ossipee. The part of Lake Ossipee, in the town of Freedom, in the area between Camp Huckins and Loon Island shall be a “no wake”area.\n\nSource. #8807, eff 1-23-07; ss by #10169, EXEMPT, eff 8-8-12 (formerly Saf-C 402.582) (See Revision Note #2 at Chapter Heading for Saf-C 5100)",
